# ReScript compiler artifacts: `lib/` is Rewatch's intermediate build cache
# (.cmi/.cmj/.ast, kept even with "in-source": true output); *.res.jsx and
# *.gen.tsx are the compiled JS and genType-emitted TS files it writes
# alongside `.res`/`.resi` source -- both regenerated by `rescript build`,
# neither meant to be committed.
lib
*.res.jsx
*.gen.tsx
